Package: systemd-resolved-gui
Version: 0.1.1-1
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Local package <danny@localhost>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, pkexec, systemd-resolved, coreutils
Description: GTK editor for systemd-resolved configuration
 A small graphical editor for the systemd-resolved configuration file.
 It keeps an initial restore point and requests administrator authorization
 only when saving or restoring the system configuration.